<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">2 Corinth</book>
  <para style="h">2 Corinth</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Corinth</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Corinth</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Corinth</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien deina zieha Jesu Khris’ sawltahpi Paul le i sanggam pa Timothy in, Corinth khuo Pasien’ hlattuom tung le Achaia gam sung tenga om misiengtho zosie tungah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I Pa Pasien le Topa Jesu Khris tung panin hepina le lungnopna thupha na tung vuah hing tung taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hepinate’ Pa le henepna zosie’ Pasien ahi i Topa Jesu Khris’ Pa Pasien in thupha nga taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasien in komama ei henep ziehin kote in zong gentheina khatpo a thuohte ka henep thei nadingun, ka gim thuohna zosie uh panin ama in ei henem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Khris sungah gimna tampi ka thuoh ma bangun ama in Khris tungtawn ma-in a kicing henepna ei pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kote in gimna ka thuoh uleh zong note’ henepna le kihutdam nading ahi hi; kote ei kihenep leh tuami pen kote thuoh bangbang note in na thuoh zawh nading vua thuohzawh hatna ang guon henepna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Note dinga ka kinepna uh a kip hi; azieh pen note in kote thuoh teng nei thuohpi ziehun kote nga ding henepna zong nei ngapi ding uhi, ci-in ka thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, Asia gam sunga ka thuoh uh gimnate thei lo-a na op ding uh ka dei sih hi; bangzieh ahei cile kote in thuoh zawh lo ding za-in gimna ka thuoh vua, hin tu zo lo ding za-in ka lung uh a kie gawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi tahpi hi, kote ka hi ule si nading thukhenna thuohin ka kingaisun vua, ahi vangin kote thuoh gimna pen ko le ko kimuong loin misite a thosah Pasien ka muon thei nading uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in tua zataha a zauhuoi si theina panin ei hunkhie zo a, zong ei honkhie lai ding hi, ci-in ama tungah kinepna ka nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi tampite’ thungetna tungtawnin kote ei kipie thupha ziehin mi tampi in kote’ adingin lungdamna ei kopieh thei nadingun, note in zong na thungetna utawh ei na panpi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kote’ kitheina teci panna tahtah tami ahi hi: Kote ka hi ule leitung pilna tawh hi loin Pasien’ hepina vang tawh siengtah le Pasien’ dei lungsim tahpi tawh leitungah ka gamta vua, note tungah a hoizaw kanin kang gamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile na sim thei ding ule na theithei dingte uh ci simlo bangma kang giel sih uhi; a tawp donga a tel sieng dingin kang lamen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa Jesu’ ni ang tun ciengin kote pen note’ kisahtheina ka hi ma bangun, note nangawn zong kote’ kisahtheina na hi lam uh note in ka thu uh phabep khat na thei zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima in tami thu ka theicien ziehin note in nivei patatna na nga thei nadingun na kung vuah kang haw masa nuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Macedonia gam ka pei kawmin note kungah hing lambangin, Macedonia panin zong kang hawkia ding a, Judea gam ka peina lamah ei hla locin ka nuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tam bang ka bawl nuom ciengin lungsim a khel themthom ka hi amah? Gelnate ka nei ciengin mi maimaite dan bangin, “Ing heh,” ci vanuh a, “Hi sih,” a cikia nianua pawl ka hi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pasien pen a muonhuoi tahpi ma bangin na kung vua kang thugente zong, “Ing heh,” zong ahi sih a, “Hi sih,” zong ahi tuon sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Azieh pen Silvanus, Timothy le keima in note lahah kang hil uh Pasien’ Tapa Jesu Khris pen, “Ing heh,” ci-in, “Hi sih,” a cikia nianua pa hi lo hi; ama sungah, “Hi hi,” a ci vive ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Azieh pen ama sungah Pasien’ kamciemte zosie, “Hi hi,” vive ahi a, tam thu ziehin Pasien’ min a than thei nadingin kote in ama tungtawnin, “Amen,” ka ci ciet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanle Khris sungah note tawh kote ei kipsah pa le sathau ei nu pa pen Pasien ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in eite tungah ama’ ciemtena seal hing tum a, i lungsim sungah ama’ Hlagau ahi malep ei guon zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin Corinth khuo-a kang hawkia lona pen note kang hepina ahi zawh lam ka teci dingin Pasien ka ko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na upna uh tungah thu nei nopna zieha tam bang a gen ka hi sih uhi; kote ka hi ule na lungdam nading vua note tawh nasemte ka hizaw uhi, azieh pen upna sungah note na ding kip uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaci’n keima in note a dasah kia dinga kang haw lo nadingin ka lungsim ka khensat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Azieh pen note hing dasah mawh leng kang dasah nomate simlo ei lungdamsah ding koi om tuon ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kang pei ciengin keima ei lungdamsah lawmte tung panin lungkhamna ka thuoh lo nadingin tami lai ang giel ka hi hi; bangzieh ahei cile keima’ lungdamna pen note zosie’ lungdamna zong hi ding hi, ci-in muonna ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile note ang lungkhamsah nuom ka hi sih a, a kicing itna tawh note kang it lam kang theisah nopna ziehin hahsatna lienpi le lungkhamna teng kawmkal panin hlitui tampi luongin lai ang hlah ka hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin mi khatpo in dana a piensah leh keima tung beha ang bawl ahi sih a, ka uong genna ahi sih a, ama in no teng zosie tungah zong bangtan cieng khat ang bawl hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi a tamzawte’ danpiehna pen tua bang mipa adingin kicing zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n lungkham seng kisa-in tua dana in ama a vuacip lo nadingin a mawna maisahin na henem zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n note in ama na itna uh na kipsahkia nading uh kang thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Note in sil bangkimah thu na mang vuoi mah, ci kang ze-et nopna le kang thei nopna zieha tami lai kang giel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Note in maw na maisah popo uh ke’n zong ka maisah hi. Mawna ka maisahte zong nomate zieha Khris’ min tawh ka maisah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Satan in ei nop neh lo nadinga eite in tamte i bawl ahi hi; azieh pen satan’ gelnate a thei lo i hi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khris’ lungdamna thu phuongzah dingin Troas khuo ka tun ciengin kei adingin Topa sungah kot khat ang kihong hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ahi vangin tua tahah ka sanggam pa Titus ka mu lo ziehin ka lung a nuom sih hi. Tuaci’n amate mangpha pai-in Macedonia ah ka peisuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khris sunga zawna pawikhamna ah kote ei pui-in muncin tengah Khris theina gimnamtui ang kizelsah Pasien tungah nuomthu tung taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile gup nga mite le a mangthai mite lahah kote pen Pasien tungah Khris’ gimnamtui ka hi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />kote ka hi ule a kisie mi khat adingin sina pan sina a ngasah gimnamtui ka hi vua, adang khat adingin hinna pan hinna a ngasah gimnamtui ka hi uhi. Tam bang nate a sem dingin koi kicing zo ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile kote ka hi ule sum nga thei nadinga Pasien’ thu a thangbawl mi tampite bang ka hi sih vua, Pasien kung pana kisawl mite bangin ama mai-ah mi citahte ka hina utawh Khris sunga thu gente ka hizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ko le ko a kiphatkia dinga kipan ka hi ta uh amah? A tahtahin mi kimkhatte in a bawl bangin note kungah ahi sihle note tung panin genphatna lai ka kisam uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Note mama pen ka lungtang tung vua a kigiel, mi zosie in simin a thei kote’ lai na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Note na hi ule kote ei kipuosah Khris’ lai na hi vua, laitui tawh kigiel ahi lo, a hing zing Pasien’ hlagau tawh a kigiel, suongpeh tunga kigiel ahi lo, mihing’ lungtang suongpeh tunga a kigiel Khris’ lai na hina na lah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khris tungtawnin kote in Pasien lamah tua bang kimuonna ka nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na khat popo ko tung pana pieng hi a, ko le ko in ka sem zo uhi, a ci ka hi sih uhi; ka sep zawhna uh pen Pasien kung pan ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in thuciem tha nasem siemte ei suohsah zo a, tua pen lai-a kigiel thukham tawh hi loin Hlagau tawh hinna ei pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu-in a muol thei ama’ maitang pana ang kikhaw a minthanna vang ziehin Israel mite in Mose’ maitang a etcien thei lo za a, sina a piengsah nasepna ahi suongpehte tunga kigielkuoh laimalte bawn minthanna tawh ang tung ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hlagau nasepna khu bangza tahin minthanna tawh ang tungzaw kan lai ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azieh pen mawsah thukhenna nasep bawn tua za-in minthang ahile, dih tanna nasepna khu nah minthan zaw kan lai ven izaw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A tahtahin a lienzaw minthanna om ta ahi ziehin nidanga a nei minthanna a nei nawn sih hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />azieh pen a kipaimangte bawn minthanna tawh tung buong sam ahile tua a kip tawntungte minthanna tawh tung zawkan lai lo ding amah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin kote in tam bang lametna nei ka hi ziehun hangtaha a sem ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kote ka hi ule ama’ minthanna vang a kipaimang lam Israel mite in a mu khah lo nadingun a maitang diel tawh a khu Moses bang ka hi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin a lungsim uh a khau mama hi. Tuni dong ciengin amate in thuciem lui a kisim a zah ciengun tua a kikhuna diel pen ma om lai hi, azieh pen Khris sung behah tua diel kipaimang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A tahtahin tuni dongin Moses’ thukham laite a kisim sielin tua diel in amau’ lungsim a khu lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa lamah mi khat a kihei ciengin a mai a khu diel kihawpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tu-in ahile Topa pen Hlagau ahi a, Topa’ Hlagau opna munah suotahna a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Eite in i unpi-un maitang kikhu loin limlang sunga ei lensawn bangin Topa’ minthanna vang i mu vua, ama’ mel sun dingin minthanna khat panin minthanna khatah i kikhel uhi; bangzieh ahei cile tami pen Hlagau ahi Topa kung pana ang pei ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin kote in Pasien’ ei hepina tawh tami nasepna ka nei ziehun ka lungkie vawt sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kote in a simtham le a zumhuoi nate ka tawpsan uhi; misol bawlnate zang loin Pasien’ thu zong ka deikai sih uhi; ahi vangin thuman thutah a langtangin ka pholah vua, Pasien’ mitmu-ah mi zosie’ kitheina lungsim tawh kituoh dingin ka gamta zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka lungdamna thu hilte uh a kikhu leh a mangthaite tung beha kikhu ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in Pasien’ lim ahi Khris’ minthanna zieha ang tang lungdamna khuovah a mu thei lo nadingun tami leitung pasien in a um lo mite’ lungsim mit a tawsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile koma’ thu a gen ka hi sih vua, Jesu Khris in Topa hi, ci thu le tua Jesu ziehin note’ sila ka hina uh ang gen ka hizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen, “Khuomiel lahah khuovah tang heh,” a ci Pasien in kote tungah Jesu Khris’ maitanga a tang Pasien’ minthanna theitheina khuovah ei pieh nadingin ama in kote’ lungsim sungah khuovah ang tangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin a lien mama tami vanglietna pen ko kung pana ang pei hi loin Pasien-a’ ahi hi, ci thu a kicien thei nadingin kote in leibeel sungah tami gougil ka nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gimna tuomtuom ka thuoh vua, hinanle netcipin ka om sih uhi; lungmangin ka om vua, hinanle lungdongin ka om sih uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />bawlsietna ka thuoh vua, hinanle taisanin ka om sih uhi; ei kisatpua a, hinanle ei kisusie lo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ka pumpi sung vuah Jesu’ hinna a kimu thei nadingin ka pumpi tung vuah Jesu’ sina ka puo zing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a si thei ka pum tung vuah Khris’ hinna a kimu thei nadingin ka hin sungun Jesu ziehin sina a thuoh dinga a kipiekhie zing ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n sina in kote sungah nasem a, ahi vangin hinna in note sungah na sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hizongle, “Keima in ka um a, tuaci’n ka genkhie hi,” ci-a kigiel Lai Siengtho dung zui-in upna hlagau kibang ka nei ziehun kote in zong umin ka gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile Topa Jesu a thosah pa in kote zong Jesu tawh ei thosah kia-in, note tawh ama opna-ah ei tun ding hi, ci ka thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi hi, sil bangkim note khuolna ahi a, Pasien’ minthan nadingin mi tam semsemte tunga a tung tua hepina in lungdamkona a khansah thei nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n kote ka hi uleh ka lung uh a kie tuon sih hi. Ka pulam pienzie un muot lam ding a manaw vangin, ka sunglam pienzie uh a nini-in thasuo semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a gentah lo bano khat sung ka thuoh uh tami gentheina in kote adingin tezawh lo a lien mama kumtawn minthanna ei bawlkhol pieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Azieh pen kote in a kimu thei nate mitsuon loin a kimu thei lo nate a mitsuon ka hi uhi; bangzieh ahei cile a kimu thei nate bakhat sung beh om ahi bo a, a kimu thei lo nate ahile kumtawnin a om hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Azieh pen i tenna uh leisiet puonbuh a kisiet a ahile khut tawh a kibawl lo, Pasien in a bawlsa kumtawn inn khat vantungah i nei lamtah i thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei i cile vantunga i ten nading mun ei kisilsah ding kal ngahla-in tami puonbuh ah khuisa-in i tau vangut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eite in tuami i sil tahtah ciengin guohtanga om bangin ei kimu nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen tami puonbuh sungah i op laitahin eite in vagih puo-in khuisa-in i tau vangut uhi, tua pen eite in puon i sil nuom lo zieh uh ahi sih a, puon ei kisebe ding i nop zieh ule hinna in a si thei pumpi a valtum ding i nop zieh uh hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tami thu ei na bawlkholpieh pa pen khamkholna van dinga Hlagau ei pie Pasien ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n eite i hi leh lungmuongtahin i om zing uhi; i pumpi sunga i op laisie Topa tawh i kigamla hi, ci i thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile muna tawh hi loin upna tawh i kalsuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi hi, eite lungmuongtahin i om vua, pumpi tawh kigamla-in Topa tawh opton ding i nuomzaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n eite in inn ah i om a, a gamla-ah i om zongin, ama lungdamsah ding tup penin i nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Khris’ thukhenna topha mai-ah eite zosie i unpi-un i kilaa valon ding vua, tuaci’n i pumpi-a i bawlsa i gamtatna utawh kizui-in a sie ahi a, a pha ahi zongin a nga ciet ding i hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin kote in Topa zatah dan ding ka thei ziehun midangte zawl ding ka hakat uhi; ahi vangin Pasien in koma mama ei theitel a, note in zong a sie le a pha na theina lungsim sung vuah ei theitel dingin kang lamen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Note mai-ah ko le ko a kiphattawm kia ka hi sih vua, a lungsim tawng uh ahi lo, a putham a kisahtheipi mite na dawnkia thei nading ule kote zieha na kisahthei nading uh hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Azieh pen ka mot uleh Pasien ading hi a, ka pil ule zong note ading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile mi zosie adingin mi khat si zo hi, ci thu thei ka hi ziehun tua Khris’ itna in kote ei thuzaw hi; tua ahi ziehin mi zosie a si uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuale ama pen mi zosie adinga ang si ahi a, tua ahi ziehin a hing tasunte zong amau’ adinga a hing hi nawn loin, amau’ adingin si-in a thokiasah pa adinga hing ahi zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-a kipanin kote in mihing mudan tawh koima ka mu nawn sih uhi; hun khat lai-in mihing mudan tawh Khris ka na thei ngai vangun, tua bang danin ama ka thei nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n mi khatpo Khris sunga a op leh a kisiemtha ahi ta hi: a lui nate zosie mangthai zo hi; en un sil bangkim a tha a suoh zo hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tami thu zosie pen Khris tungtawnin ama tawh kote ei kilemsahkia Pasien kung pan ahi hi; ama in kote tungah kilemkiana nasep ei pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua pen a deina bang ahei cile Pasien in amau’ thupalsatnate ciemte loin, Khris sungah leitung mite le ama a kilemsahkia a, ama in tua kilemkiana thu a gen dinga kote ei ngansie ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n kote pen Khris adingin palaite ka hi uhi; Pasien tawh na kilem un, ci-in Pasien in kote tungtawnin ang thum ma bangin kote in zong Khris tangin kang thum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama sungah Pasien’ dihna ka tan thei nadingun, mawna a thei lo pa pen kote tang dingin Pasien in mawnei mi a suohsah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ama tawh na semton ka hi bangun Pasien’ hepina a mawhna-a a sang ka suo lo nadingun kang thum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Azieh pen ama in, “San thei hunin na thu gen uh ka ngai a, hutdamna ni ciengin note kang hu hi,” a ci hi. En un, tulaitah pen san thei hun tah ahi hi; tulaitah pen hutdamna ni ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka nasep vuah khielna a kimu lo nadingin mi khatpo’ lampi-ah pua nading bangma ka koi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hizongle ko mama in Pasien’ nasemte ka hina uh sil bangkimah ka kilangsah uhi: thuohzawhna lienpite, genthei liengvainate, hahsatnate, vangsietnate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />satnate, thongkiehnate, buoinate, na ham sepnate, zanlai-a kimutmaw law nate, le gilkielnate ahi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />siengthona, thu theina, lungduoina, migitna, lungsim siengthona, itna tahtah tawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />thuman thutah genna le Pasien’ vanglietnate a kipan, zietlam le veilam ading dihna galhiemte tawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />patawina le simmawna ahi zongin, gensietna le genphatnate dong ciengah ka langsah uhi. Kote pen mi thumante ka hi vangun zuouthu gente bangin ei kingaisun hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />mi zosie in ei theitel vangin koima’ thei lote ka bang uhi; nei thei bangun a hing ka hi vangun a si dihtahte bangin ei kingaisun hi; gawtna dan ka thuoh vangun thalupin ka om sih uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a date tawh ka kibah vangun ka lungdam zing uhi; a zawng ka bah mawh vangun mi tampi ka hausah uhi; bangma nei lo ka bah vangun na zosie ka nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />No Corinth mite kungah siengtahin kang gen zo vua, ka lungsim uh ka golhon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kote’ itna sungah ciengtan bangma a om sih a, noma’ sunga om hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kote-a’ bangin a kilawmin nei thuhkiana-un note in zong na lungsim uh golhon un, ci-in tate tunga thugen bangin kang gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thu um lo mite tawh a kituoh lo hahkol na puoton sih un. Azieh pen dihna le gitlona kikalah bang kipawlna om thei ding ahei? Ahi sihle khuovah le khuomiel kikalah bang kipawlna om thei ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khris in Beliar tawh bang thukimna nei ahei? Ahi sihle thu um mi khat in thu um lo mi khat tawh bang neiton ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pasien’ biehinnpi in milimte tawh bang kithukimna nei ahei? Bangzieh ahei cile eite pen a hing zing Pasien’ biehinnpi i hi uhi. Pasien in, “Amate sungah tengin a lah vuah ka vah ding a, amau’ Pasien hi-in, amate keima’ mi ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ziehin amate kung panin hing peikhie unlen, amate lah panin a tuomin om un, Topa in ci hi. A sieng lo poma tham kha sih un, tua hile keima in note kang sang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Keima na pa uh kang hi ding a, note zong keima’ tapate le tanute na hi ding uhi,” Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka itte aw, eite in tam bang thuciemte i nei zo tah ngalin pumpi le hlagau buana zosie panin eima le eima kisiensuo-in Pasien zatahna lamah siengthona bukimsah vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na lungtang sung vuah kote ading mun ei pie un; koima tungah ka khiel kha sih vua, koima khat zong siesah loin kote’ phattuom nadingin koima khat zong ka zang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Note mawsah nopna tawh tami thu a gen ka hi sih hi, azieh pen i si leh sitonin i hin lezong a hington dingin ka lungsim sung vuah na om uhi, ci-in masang lai-in kang gen zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Note tungtangah tamveipi ka kisathei hi; note tungah kisahtheina lienpi ka nei hi; henepna tawh ka kidim hi; ka thuoh uh gentheina zosie-ah genzawh loin ka lung a dam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Macedonia ka tun cieng nangawnun ka pumpi un khawl hun ci a nei sih a, ka kiheina zosie vuah gimna thuohin, a pulamah kihauna, le a sunglamah zaunate a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin a lungkie mite a henem Pasien in Titus ang tunna tawh kote ei henem a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ama ang tunna hang beh hi loin, note in ama na henepna hang uh zong ahi hi. Note in kei nei lunggulna uh, na dana ule keima dinga nei deisahnate uh zong ei gen a, tuaci’n ka kipah semsem lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile kang laihlahna tawh note kang dasah lezong ka kisiakia sih a, (kisiakia nanleng tua laihlah tawh kang dasahna uh pen bakhat sung beh hi lel hi, ci ka thei hi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu-in kei ka kipah hi; na da zieh vua kipah ka hi sih a, na dana un ang kisiakiasahna zieha kipah ka hizaw hi; bangzieh ahei cile banglam banglamah kote ziehin bangma suplaw loin Pasien’ deina tawh kituoha a da na hizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen Pasien’ deina tawh a kituoh dana in hutdamna ei tut thei kisiakiana piengsah a, da nading bangma a om sih hi, ahi vangin leitung dana in sina a piengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tami Pasien lama dana in note sungah bang citahna, no le no kisiensuo nadingin bang lawpna, bang lungthahna, bang patauna, bang lunggulna, bang pawnthawna, bang gawtnate piengsah ahei ci thu en un! Note in tami thu-ah bang mun bang munah na maw lo lam uh na kilangsah zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n keima in lai kang hlah vangin khielna bawl pa ahi sihle khielna thuoh pa zieha kang giel ahi sih a, note in Pasien mai-ah kote nei deisahna a kilah thei nadinga ang giel ka hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tami thu-ah ka lung uh a nuom mama hi. Kote lungmuonna beh hi loin note zosie zieha Titus in lungsim tawldamna nga ahi ziehin ama’ lungdamna ziehin ka lungdam deudeu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile note kang kisielpina thu pawlkhat ama kungah gen nanleng ka maizum tuon sih hi; hinanle a hi bangbanga note tunga kang gensa thu zosie a man ahi ma bangin, Titus tunga ka kipawhna uzong a man ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Note zosie in bangci bangin thumangin zauna le linna tawh ama na sanna lam uh a ngaisutkia ciengin note ang itna a khang semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Note tungah a bukim lungmuonna ka nei ziehin ka kipah mama hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, note in Macedonia gam hlattuom pawlpite tunga kipie Pasien’ hepina thu na thei ding uh ka dei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />azieh pen amate in gentheina lienpi a thuoh hun sungun zawng mama nan ule zong a lungdamna uh lien luo ahi ziehin amau’ lam panin piehkhietna lamsang a kiphal mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile amate in a nei za uh dung zui-in pieh nopna lungsim tawh a pie vua, a nei za uh sanga a tamzaw nangawnin zong a pie uhi, ci thu teci ka pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tam misiengthote adinga nasepna-ah amate kihalin hamphatna a nga thei nadingun kote kungah ang thum ngetngut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua khu kote’ lametna maimai bang ahi sih a, amate mama Topa tungah kipie masa-in, tua zaw ciengin Pasien’ deina bangin amate in ko tunga ang kipiekhie uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n Titus in tam bang nasep a patsa ahi ma bangin, amate in note lahah tami phalna nasep a sep suoh nadingun amate ka hanthawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu-in note in thu upna, thugenna, thu theina, nasep hakatna le nei itna vua kipanin midangte sangin bang kimah na tung tuon zawh ma bangun, tami phalna nasepna-ah zong na tungtuong un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thupieh dan banga ang gen ka hi sih a, midangte’ hakatna tawh sittelin na itna uh a tahtah amah ci thu ka theinopna hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azieh pen i Topa Jesu Khris zong hau mama napi note ang khuolna ziehin ama’ zawnna tawh note mihau na suo thei nadingun, note ziehin ama mizawng hing suoh ahi ziehin note in kiphalna tawh ama’ nasepna na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tami thu-ah ka ngaisutna kang pie hi: Nuasie kumin bang khat sep ding a pan masa beh na hi sih vua, bang khat sep ding nangawn a lunggul note adingin tua bang na bawl ding uh a kilawm ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na neisa uh tawh kizui-in note in na hakatna ule na nasep man ding uh a kituo thei nadingin tu-in tami nasep zo sieng un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile thanopna a op nah po leh nei lona pansia loin neina tawh kizui-a kipie letsong pen a santah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi dangte donghu dinga ang pau bawl hi loin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />na kikal vuah na kihu diemdiem nading uh ka cinopna hizaw a, tulai taha na citheina un amau’ tasapna hu-in, amau’ citheina in zong note’ tasapna ang hukia ding ka deina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tampi a khawmte-a’ val tuon loin them khat a khawmte-a’ zong cingla tuon lo hi,” ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin Titus’ lungsim sungah kei nei banga thanopna lungsim a guon pa Pasien tungah nuomthu ka tut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Azieh pen ama in kote’ ngetna ei sang khop loin, nidang sangin a thanop zawh ziehin ama’ thu-a na kung vua ang haw sawm ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lungdamna thu a genna zieha hlattuom pawlpi zosie-ah a kithang sanggampa khat ama tawh kang zawhsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua beh hi loin, Topa mama’ minthan nading le ka lungsim hoina uh a kilah nadingin, ama pen tami phalna nasepna ka sep sungun ka khuolzinpi ding vua hlattuom pawlpite in a se pa zong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Phalna tawh a kipie tami letsongte ka zehna vuah koima in ei mawsah lo nadingin ka kidawm mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa muna behah a man gamtat sawm hi khop loin, mihingte muna-ah zong a man a gamtat sawm ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua thu tamveipitah sittelin citah hi, ci-a ka mu sa uh i sanggam pa khat amate tawh kang zawhsah hi. Ama in note ang muon mama ziehin a lawp tasem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Titus pen note ading nasepna-ah ka kithuopi le ka naseppi ahi hi; i sanggamte ahi ule Khris’ min a thangsah hlattuom pawlpite’ kamtaite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin note’ itna le kote in note zieha ka kisielna uh a hang bang ahei ci hlattuom pawlpite mai-ah siengtahin na lah un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in misiengthote adinga nasepna tawh kisai-in lai kang hlah ding uh a kisam nawn sih hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />azieh pen na mi hunopna lungsim uh ka thei a, tua pen Macedonia mite tunga ka kisielpisa ahi hi. Ning kuma kipanin Achaia gam mite a kithawikhol zo ta uhi, ci-in ka na gen hi; tua na lawpna un amate a tamzaw a thanuomsah tuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanle keima in tami thu-ah kang kisielpina uh a mawhna a suo lo nadingin na kigingkhol un, kang cisa ma bangin na kiginkhol thei nadingun sanggamte kang sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua bang hi loin keima kang pei ciengin Macedonia-te pawlkhat in ei zui hinlen, na kiginkhol lo lam uh hing muhai kha mawh uleh nohaw’ maizum ding genda vai, tami nasepna-ah ka mai uh a zum mama ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n pieh dinga na kamciemsa uh tami huna letsongte a baisa-in omin, sawl zawh thu tawh hi lo, phalna tawh ahi nadinga thu vaihawm dingin na kung vuah sanggamte ang mahaw thei nadingin kut ding kisam ka sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka gennop thu tami ahi hi: Khaici themkhat a vawte in themkhat a at ding vua, tampi a vawte in tampi ma at ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi zosie in na lungsim sung vuah pieh dinga na khensatsa bangun na pie ciet ding vua, lungsi pipi ahi sihle pieh lo phamaw ci dan tawh na pie sih ding uhi, bangzieh ahei cile Pasien in lungtaitaha a pie mite a it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sil bangkim a kicinga na nei zing nading ule na hoi sepna zosie-ah kicingtaha na kihal thei nadingun Pasien in thupha namcin a kiningcingin note ang pie thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ama in hawmthangin, mizawngte tungah pie a, ama’ dihna kip tawntung hi,” ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khaici vawpa tungah khaici le neh ding an a sih pa in na vaw ding uh khaici zong hing sih ding a, na vaw ding uh khaici hing khangsahin na dihna uh zong hing pungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na kiphalna lienpi uh ziehin na zosie-ah ang kihausah ding a, tua in kote tungtawnin Pasien tungah lungdamkona a piengsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tami nasepna in misiengthote tasapna beh a sih ahi khop sih a, Pasien tungah lungdam ko nading tampi tawh zong a dimletsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tami nasepna sittelna tungtawnin note in Khris’ lungdamna pulahna thu na manna ule, amate le midang zosiete tawh phal taha na piehnate ziehun Pasien’ min na thangsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tezawh lo note ang kipie Pasien’ hepina ziehin amate in ang lunggul mama vua, thu zong ang ngetpieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A kigen zo lo ei hlawnpieh ama’ letsong ziehin Pasien tungah lungdam i ko uhi!
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Note tawh i kimaituo cienga a kiniemsah pa le i kigamlat cienga note tunga a hangsan pa keima Paul in Khris’ nunnemna le migitna tawh kang thum hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leitung mite dan tawh a gamta-a ei ngaisunte tungah keima kang op ciengin hang taha ci ka sawm bangin ci a kul lo nadingin kang thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Leitung mite bangin ka ten vangun leitung mite’ zie zui-in gal ka do sih uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile kote’ zah galdona hiemte ahile mihingte’ galhiem maimaite ahi sih a, galte’ panmun phuolpite a susie zo Pasien’ vanglietna hizaw hi. Kote in kiselnate le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pasien’ thu theina ding a khahtan thei kiphatsahna vannuoi ka susie gawp vua, Khris’ thu a mang dingin ngaisutna vannuoi salin ka man uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na thumanna uh a kicin ciengin thumang lo zosie dan pie dingin a kigingsa-in ka om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na maitang vua nate en un. Khris-a’ ka hi hi, ci-in na kimuon uleh note, Khris-a’ na hi ma bangun ko zong Khris-a’ ma ka hina thu uh phawh ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tu-in note suhsiet nading hi lo, na kilam nadingun Topa in ei pieh thuneina tawmkhat hing kinah sielpi phiel leng zong ka maizum sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka laihlahte tawh ang zausah ka suo khah ding ka nuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile amate in, “A laihlahte khau-in nasie mama napi eite tawh a opton tah ciengin thahat vawt loin, a thugente zong bangma ahi sih hi,” ei ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua bang mite in kang op lo sung vua laihlah tawh ka gente uh kang op tah ciengun ang sem ding ka hi lam uh na kithei ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kote ka hi ule amau le amau a kiphattawmte tawh a kisimton ahi sihle a kitekah ngam ka hi sih uhi. Ahi vangin amate khatlekhat a kitekah ciengun theisiemna a nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hizongle a kalvalin ka kisiel sih ding vua, ahi vangin Pasien in kote adinga ei sesahsa za ahi note kung dong nangawn zong kang bat zawhna uh cieng behah ka kisiel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azieh pen na kung vua kang tun ciengun ka ciengtan uh vala a kalsuon ka hi sih uhi; kote ka hi ule note kungah Khris’ lungdamna thu tawh ang tung masa pente ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Midangte’ nasepnate-ah a kalvalin ka kisiel sih vua, hinanle kote lametna ahile na upna uh a khanna tawh kizui-in ka nasepna huong uzong na tangzaisah semsem ding uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua hile kote in midangte nasepna huong sunga kisemsate kisielpi loin na gam uh hlengin lungdamna thu ka tangko thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“A kisiel mi in Topa sungah kisiel taheh”.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Azieh pen ama le ama a kiphattawm mipa kisang lo a, ahi vangin Topa in a phat mite kisang hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka mot opna nengneng teng ei ngaisiem locin ka nuom hi. Ei ngaisiem bo un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Note adingin Pasien’ ei deisahna ka nei hi, bangzieh ahei cile keima in pasal khat tawh kinung ngahnu siengtho khat bangin Khris tunga pieh dingin note kang kamciem zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin gulpi in a ngienku tawh Eve a na sol bangin Khris tungah a dih le a siengtho na kipumpiehna panun na ngaisutnate uh na pielsah khah ding uh ka lung a himaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen mi khatpo ang pei-in kang hilsa uh ahi lo adang Jesu’ thu ang hil a, ahi sihle note in na ngasa uh ahi lo adang hlagau khat nga-in, ahi sihle na sansa uh lungdamna thu ahi lo adang lungdamna thu khat ang hil ciengin na sang paipai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kote ka hi ule tami a thupi mama sawltahpite sangin a neu zaw-in ka kingaisun tuon vawt sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thugen lamah ei kicil lo ka hi thei mai ding a, hinanle theina lamah ei kicil lo ka hi sam sih hi; note tungah tam bang ka hina sil bangkimah a kicien sinsenin ka langsah zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Note ang kitawisang nadingin keima le keima kiniemsahin man ngen loin Pasien’ lungdamna thu ka gen ziehin mawna a bawl ka hi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na na sem dingin hlattuom pawlpi dangte tung panin huna sang ka hi ziehin amau’ sum a lahpieh ka suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Note tawh omtonin kisapna ka nei ciengin Macedonia gam pana ang pei ka lawmte in ka sapnate ei sih ziehun koima vangih ka suon sih hi. Tuaci’n lam khatpopo-ah note’ vangih ka suo lo nadingin ka kideh a, ka kideh lai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima sungah Khris’ thuman thutah a op ma bangin Achaia gam sung muncin tengah tami ka kisahtheipi pen gen loin ka dai op sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahile bangzieh ahei? Ke’n note kang it lo zieh amah? Kang it lam uh Pasien in thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kote tawh a kikim dan a ciemtena a deite’ kisielna ka niel zawh nadingin ke’n zong ka sep pen ma ka semsuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tua bang mite pen sawltahpi man lote ahi a, amau le amau Khris’ sawltahpi a kipang mi sol nasemte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua pen lamdang sah ding ahi sih hi! Azieh pen Satan nangawn khuovah vantungmi khat bangin a kipangtawm thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n dihna tate bangin ama’ nasemte a kipantawm uleh lamdang sah ding ahi sih hi. Amau’ gamtatna bangin a tawpna-ah a thuoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Koima in a maw-in ei ngaisun sih un, ci-in kang genkia hi; hinanle a maw a nei ngaisut uleh tawmkhat beh ka kisiel thei nadingin mimawte bangin ei ngaisunin ei sang veve un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kimuong a, tami ka kisielna tungtanga kang gen ding thute pen Topa’ thuneina tawh ang gen ka hi sih a, mimaw khat banga ang gen ka hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi tampite in leitung ziete a kisielpi ziehun kei zong ka kisiel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile nomate na pil ziehun lungdamtahin mimawte na thuoh zo veve uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Azieh pen mi khat in salin hing bawlin, ahi sihle hing netumin, ahi sihle hing metbawlin, ahi sihle kiliensahin ang pheta beh ciengin zong note in na thuoh zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua banga bawl ding lamah kote ka thanem nah mama uhi, ci-in maizum pipi-in kang gen hi! Ahi vangin mimaw khat bangin thu hing gen leng: Mi khatpo in a kisielpi ngam pen kei zong ka kisielpi ngam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate Hebrew-te ahi uh amah? Kei zong ka hi hi. Amate Israel-te ahi uh amah? Kei zong ka hi hi. Amate Abraham’ suonlehlahte ahi uh amah? Kei zong tua bang ma ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate Khris’ nasemte ahi uh amah? Mimaw khat bangin ham tadi leih, amate sangin ka hoizaw buong sam hi: Amate sangin na ka nahsep zaw a, thong zong ka tamkieh zaw hi. Simzawh lo satna ka thuoh a, tamveipitah sikhielin ka ommun zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Judah-te’ satna sawmli-ah khat a kiemin ngavei tah ka thuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ciengpum tawh thumvei ei kisat a, khatvei suong tawh ei kisep hi. Tembaw kisietna thumvei ka tuoh ngai hi; sun khat le zan khat tuipi tungah ka om ngai hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />khuol ka zin munnate-ah keima in guntui khang panin zauhuoina, misuomte tung panin zauhuoina, ka mipite tung panin zauhuoina, Gentile-te tung panin zauhuoina, khuopi sunga zauhuoina, gamlaha zauhuoina, tuipi tunga zauhuoinate a kipanin sanggam man lote tung panin zauhuoinate ka tuoh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />nasep gimin hamsatna sungah omin, zan lai-in tamveipi tah kimu maw liengin ka om hi. Tuale gilkielna le dangtana a kipanin neh ding nei loin tamveipi ka om a, puon sil ding nei loin damsi-in ka om ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thudangte banah hlattuom pawlpi zosiete ading lunghimaw-in ka lunggimpi lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka thanempi lo koi om ahei? Ka lungkhampi lo-a mawna sunga kipuasah koi om ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kisiel lo phamaw ding ahile ka thanemna ei kilangsah nate ma ka kisielpi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pasien le Topa Jesu’ Pa (ama in thupha nga tawntung taheh!) in ka zuou lo lamtah thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Keima ei mat thei nadingin Damascus khuo Kumpi Aretas’ khut nei-a om gam-uhpa in Damascus khuopi a cingsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hizongle seu khat sungah ei kikoi-in kul kotneu vang panin ei kikhiesuh a, ama’ khut sung panin ka suohta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bangma phattuom nading om sih nanle ka kisiel ding a kisam ahi hi; hinanle ka mangmunate le Topa’ ang kilahnate ka gengen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tu masang kum sawm le kum li lai-in Khris sunga a om mi khat vantung dawl thumna-ah a kilahto lam ka thei a, a pumpi tawh amah, a pumpi lo tawh ahei ci ka thei sih hi; Pasien in a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua mipa, a pumpi tawh amah, a pumpi lo tawh ahei ci zong ka thei sih hi; Pasien in a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Paradise ah a kilato a, gen lo ding thute, mihing koima khat beh in a genkia dinga a kiphal lo thute a za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua bang mi pa khat ziehin ka kisiel ding a, hizongle ka thanemnate ah ci simlo ka kisiel sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin thutah gen ding ka hi ziehin kisiel nuom leng mimaw ka hi tuon sih ding hi, a zieh pen keima sunga a mu ule keima tung pana a zahte uh sangin a thupizaw-a koima in ei ngaisut lo nadingin kisiel ding ka kidawm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tua a lamdang kilahna dante nangawn ngaisutin ka nei sih hi. Tua ahi ziehin ka kisahthei luot lo nadingin ka tahsa sungah ei bawlsie ding Satan’ kamtai ahi ling khat ei kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei tung panin tua lingtang a kilahkhiet nadingin Topa tungah thumvei thu ka ngen a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />hinanle ama in keima kungah, “Nangma dingin ka hepina a kicing hi, azieh pen thanemna sungah ka vanglietna a kicing hi,” ei ci hi. Tuaci’n ka sungah Khris’ vanglietna a ten thei nadingin kipahtahin ka thanemnate ka kisielpi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahi tah ziehin Khris hangin thanemnate, zakonate, hahsatnate tungah ka lung a kim hi; azieh pen ka thanem ciengin ka tha a hat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kei mimaw ka hi ta hi! Tua dinga nei paubawl uh ahi hi. A tahtahin kei pen nei pahtah lawm uh ka hi hi, bangzieh ahei cile bangma ka hi lo vangin tami sawltahpi lien pente sangin ka neuzaw tuon sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Note lahah sawltahpi man khat’ hina a lah ahi limte, sil lamdangte, le vanglietna nasepnate kibawl zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei mama in note vangih kang suon lo ci simlo hlattuom pawlpi dangte sangin bangci-in a siezaw-in na om ngai ta uh ahei? Tami ka khiel khahna ei ngaidam un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na kung vua ang haw dinga ka kiginna tami khu a thumveina vawt ahi ta hi. Na neisate uh a deigaw ka hi sih a, noma mama ang dei ka hi zawh ziehin note’ vangih ka suoh sih ding hi; bangzieh ahei cile tate in nu le pate dingin nei le lam kholpieh loin, nu le pate in tate adingin a kholpieh ding hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Note adingin ka neisate kipahtahin ka zang ding a, keima ma zong ka kipumpieh nuom hi. Note hing it semsem leng ei tawm it semsem ding na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Note vangih ang suon loin ei kingaisun taheh. Ahi vangin note in kei mi ngiansiem ka hi ziehin solna tawh ang manin nei gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na kung vua kang sawl mi khatpo tungtawnin a met lahna-in kang nei uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na kung vua haw dingin Titus ka kun a, i sanggam pa kang zuisah hi. Titus in note a met lahna-in ang nei sih hi, hi lo amah? Lungsim kibanga a semton hi lo uh ka mah? Ka kalsuonzie uh kibang hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Note mai-ah koma le koma a kiphelphelin ei ngaisun na hi uh amah? Kote pen Khris sunga omte bangin Pasien mai-a thugengen ka hi uhi. Ka itte aw, ka sepna zosie uh pen note kilamkip nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile kang tun ciengin ka dei banga kang mu lo khah ding ule note in zong na dei bang vua nei mu lo khah ding uh ka zau hi; note lahah kihauna, hazatna, lungthahna, huoihamna, kidaisahna, kigensietna, kihisahna, le buoinate a op khah ding ka zau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kang hawkia ciengin ka Pasien in na mai vuah ei niemkhiehin nidanga na khielnasa uh mawnate ahi, siengtho lona, nulepa mawna, thangtatnate vang tawh maw napi a kisia lo ziehun mi tampi ziehin da le kapin ka op khah ding ka zau hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na kung vua kang haw nading a thumveina ahi ta hi. “Mawmatna khatpopo teci ni ahi sihle thum’ theipina tawh a kip hi ding hi,” kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mawna a bawl mite le midang zosie tungah thuhilna kang nei zo hi, a niveina kang haw lai-in zong kang hilsa ma bangin tu ka op lo sungin kang hil a, kang hawkia leh koima kang za nawn sih ding hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />azieh pen note in kei tungah Khris in thu a gen lam a kicien lahtelna na dei sese uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile thanemna ziehin singlamte tungah a na kithalia mawh vangin Pasien’ vanglietna tawh ama a hingkia hi. Azieh pen ama sungah ka tha uh a nem a, hinanle note tawh kipawlna-ah Pasien’ vanglietna ziehin ama tawh ka hington ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Upna sunga a nungta na hi ngel vuoi mah ci no le no kisittel un. No le no kize-et un. Na kisittelna vuah a lawsam na hi sih nah uleh na sung vuah Khris a op lam thei lo na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Note in a lawsam ka hi lo lam uh ei thei na va uteh ci-in ka lamen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A lawcing ka hina uh a kilah ding deina hi loin, note a mana na gamtat nading uh deina tawh thu ngen ka hizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile kote in thuman thutah langdo-in bangma ka sem thei sih vua, thuman thutah ading behin ka semzaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azieh pen kote thanemin note na thahat ciengun ka kipah uhi. Kote’ thungetna pen note’ kicingtah thei nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima kang tun ciengin note siet nading hi loin na kilamkip nadingun, na tung vuah Topa in keima ei pieh thuneina kang khauzah seng lo nadingin note tawh i kigamlat sung vua tami lai kang giel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A tawpna-ah sanggamte aw, mangpha na man ta un. Na opdante uh puopha-in kang ngetnate na ngai unlen, khatlekhat kithutuohin kilemin na om un; tua hile itna le kilemna Pasien in note ang ompi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A siengtho kinapna tawh khatlekhat na kinoset un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Misiengtho zosie in note ang noset uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa Jesu Khris’ ei hepina, Pasien’ ei itna le Hlagau Siengtho tawh kipawl theina in note zosie tawh hing om taheh.
  </para>
</usx>
